{"synopsis":"I-an dan Muyeol dikenal di kalangan teman-temannya sebagai pasangan yang penuh kasih sayang. Pada peringatan pernikahan ke-9 mereka, Muyeol memberi I-an sebuah gedung di Cheongdam-dong untuk memperluas galerinya. Mereka menghabiskan malam yang lebih penuh gairah dari biasanya, dan sepertinya itu adalah peringatan pernikahan yang sempurna… Hingga Muyeol diam-diam keluar untuk menemui selingkuhannya.","alternative_title":"나의 바람은 죄가 아니다","author":"Jinja","artist":"So Hwi","chapters":[{"number":"57","chapter":"57","slug":"a3eccc99-cbeb-4d05-b9eb-caf1689e96bc","title":"Chapter 57","date":"2026-07-18"},{"number":"56","chapter":"56","slug":"7f0a285f-2643-492f-a97c-47dae3899aea","title":"Chapter 56","date":"2026-07-10"},{"number":"55","chapter":"55","slug":"728a73ff-f568-46e5-9d4a-f4a80fb5b9e3","title":"Chapter 55","date":"2026-07-10"},{"number":"54","chapter":"54","slug":"c06457f1-1aea-48a6-8aeb-d1ac22eeb01a","title":"Chapter 54","date":"2026-07-02"},{"number":"53","chapter":"53","slug":"2c274b43-353d-4b04-ab4b-8ef4ff1b321f","title":"Chapter 53","date":"2026-07-02"},{"number":"52","chapter":"52","slug":"708f9998-e8ff-4d51-85ab-705253509f13","title":"Chapter 52","date":"2026-07-02"},{"number":"51","chapter":"51","slug":"997e7459-b3d6-4960-a621-95ea9e8fc350","title":"Chapter 51","date":"2026-07-02"},{"number":"50","chapter":"50","slug":"5e45924d-ef1a-450f-a6f1-cfd6c3dbea51","title":"Chapter 50","date":"2026-07-02"},{"number":"49","chapter":"49","slug":"f377330f-f5d0-4c0d-959e-26d173fa798c","title":"Chapter 49","date":"2026-07-02"},{"number":"48","chapter":"48","slug":"1939f1ec-e147-42a9-9485-6810b8b9a290","title":"Chapter 48","date":"2026-05-13"},{"number":"47","chapter":"47","slug":"a85ecc3e-40a3-4c46-9804-0ba1ede94797","title":"Chapter 47","date":"2026-05-13"},{"number":"46","chapter":"46","slug":"8c172ed7-95a3-4513-ba88-be04c66a527c","title":"Chapter 46","date":"2026-05-13"},{"number":"45","chapter":"45","slug":"8d0a9fea-93e1-4120-9d4f-36e4feb95371","title":"